projects.description:
Language: Java.
Platforms: POS machine which runs Android.
Tech: IOT, USB otg, Bluetooth.

The purpose of this project is to help the tea shop can easily to sell the drink by Pos machine.
The main function:
- Shows the product; 
- Make and Order; 
- Print recipes for the customer via thermal printer by USB cab and bluetooth; 
- Purchase by visa card with the POS machine to read the data from the visa card.
- Work with pax s300. Ingenico ipp350 for the transaction.
